---
import GlyphIcon from './GlyphIcon.astro';
import NavPhotoIcon from './NavPhotoIcon.astro';
import PhotoConversionArt from './PhotoConversionArt.astro';
import PhotoFileIcon from './PhotoFileIcon.astro';
import ActionIcon from './ActionIcon.astro';
import ArrowIcon from './ArrowIcon.astro';
import {PHOTO_FORMATS} from '../photo/files';
import '../photo/photo.css';
const previous=Astro.url.searchParams.get('job');
---
<main id="main" class="jc-photo-converter" data-photo-converter>
 <header class="jc-photo-hero"><div><p class="jc-photo-eyebrow"><NavPhotoIcon size={37}/> PHOTO TO COLORING PAGE</p><h1>Turn your photo<br/><span>into a coloring page.</span></h1><p>Convert a photo into printable outlines while keeping its composition. Adjust the line detail and fill settings, compare the result, then download or color online.</p><div class="jc-photo-promises"><span><GlyphIcon name="privacy" size={20}/>Private on your device</span><span>Original composition</span><span>No AI credits needed</span></div></div><div class="jc-photo-hero-art"><PhotoConversionArt size={300}/><span>FROM A MOMENT<br/><b>TO A LITTLE MASTERPIECE</b></span></div></header>
 {previous&&/^[a-f0-9-]{36}$/.test(previous)&&<p class="jc-photo-previous">Looking for your earlier AI result? <a href={`/create/text/?job=${previous}`}>Open that saved result <ArrowIcon size={16}/></a></p>}
 <div class="jc-photo-workspace"><section class="jc-photo-settings" aria-labelledby="photo-upload-title"><div class="jc-photo-section-title"><span>01</span><div><p>MAKE IT PERSONAL</p><h2 id="photo-upload-title">Start with your photo.</h2></div></div>
 <form id="photo-converter-form"><label class="jc-photo-upload" data-photo-drop><input type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" class="sr-only" id="photo-converter-input" aria-label="Choose a photo to convert"/><div data-photo-empty><NavPhotoIcon size={75}/><strong>Drop a photo here</strong><span>or choose one from your device</span><small>JPG, PNG or WEBP · up to 20 MB / 32 MP</small></div><img data-photo-source alt="Your selected original photo" hidden/><span class="jc-photo-replace" data-photo-replace hidden><NavPhotoIcon size={23}/> Choose another photo</span></label><p class="jc-photo-source-info" data-photo-source-info>Nothing is uploaded. Your photo stays in this tab.</p>
 <div class="jc-photo-control-heading"><h3>Choose your outline style.</h3><p>Keep more details or give the lines a little breathing room.</p></div><div class="jc-photo-presets" role="group" aria-label="Outline presets"><button type="button" data-photo-preset="clean" aria-pressed="false">Clean & simple</button><button type="button" data-photo-preset="balanced" aria-pressed="true">Balanced</button><button type="button" data-photo-preset="detailed" aria-pressed="false">Fine details</button></div>
 <label class="jc-photo-range-label" for="photo-detail">Detail <output id="photo-detail-value">55</output></label><input id="photo-detail" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="55"/><div class="jc-photo-range-ends"><span>Fewer small lines</span><span>More photo detail</span></div>
 <label class="jc-photo-range-label" for="photo-smoothing">Smooth fine texture <output id="photo-smoothing-value">45</output></label><input id="photo-smoothing" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="45"/><div class="jc-photo-range-ends"><span>Keep texture</span><span>Cleaner surfaces</span></div>
 <label class="jc-photo-range-label" for="photo-cleanup">Remove stray detail <output id="photo-cleanup-value">55</output></label><input id="photo-cleanup" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="55"/><div class="jc-photo-range-ends"><span>Keep delicate texture</span><span>Roomier coloring areas</span></div>
 <fieldset class="jc-photo-weight"><legend>Line weight</legend><div>{['fine','medium','bold'].map((weight,i)=><label><input type="radio" name="photo-weight" value={weight} checked={i===1}/><span><svg viewBox="0 0 35 16" width="35" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12C11-7 22 23 32 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={i+1.2} stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>{weight==='fine'?'Fine':weight==='medium'?'Medium':'Bold'}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
 <label class="jc-photo-gap"><input id="photo-close-gaps" type="checkbox" checked/><span><strong>Make areas easier to fill</strong><small>Strengthen faint boundaries and close small gaps using your photo.</small></span></label>
 <details class="jc-photo-engine"><summary>Processor options</summary><label for="photo-engine">Outline method</label><select id="photo-engine"><option value="smart">Photo-faithful drawing · recommended</option><option value="direct">Direct trace · lightweight</option></select><p>A local drawing model follows the shapes in your photo, with texture smoothing and print cleanup. The first use downloads about 32 MB. Your photo stays on your device. Direct trace is a lighter alternative.</p></details>
 <button class="jc-photo-primary" type="submit" data-photo-convert disabled><NavPhotoIcon size={31}/><span>Create my coloring page</span><ArrowIcon size={20}/></button><div class="jc-photo-minor-actions"><button type="button" data-photo-cancel hidden>Stop processing</button><button type="button" data-photo-reset>Start fresh</button></div><p class="jc-photo-status" data-photo-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a photo to get started.</p></form></section>
 <section class="jc-photo-output" aria-labelledby="photo-output-title"><div class="jc-photo-section-title"><span>02</span><div><p>YOUR PHOTO. READY TO COLOR.</p><h2 id="photo-output-title">Ready for your colors.</h2></div><span class="jc-photo-ready" data-photo-ready hidden>Outlines ready</span></div>
 <div class="jc-photo-preview-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Photo preview mode"><button type="button" data-photo-view="line" aria-pressed="true" disabled>Coloring page</button><button type="button" data-photo-view="compare" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Compare original</button><button type="button" data-photo-view="original" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Original photo</button></div>
 <div class="jc-photo-result-frame" data-photo-frame data-view="line"><div class="jc-photo-result-empty" data-photo-result-empty><PhotoConversionArt size={285}/><h3>A moment worth coloring.</h3><p>Your converted photo will appear here.<br/>Create a coloring page from the image you choose.</p></div><canvas data-photo-canvas role="img" aria-label="Black-and-white coloring outline created from your photo" hidden></canvas><img data-photo-comparison-source alt="The original photo for comparison" hidden/><div class="jc-photo-compare-divider" data-photo-divider hidden aria-hidden="true"><span><ArrowIcon kind="left" size={14}/><ArrowIcon size={14}/></span></div><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" data-photo-comparison aria-label="Compare original photo with coloring outlines" hidden/></div><div class="jc-photo-result-caption"><span data-photo-dimensions>Your photo’s proportions are preserved.</span><span data-photo-method>Processed on your device</span></div>
 <p class="jc-photo-region-note" data-photo-regions role="status"></p>
 <div class="jc-photo-fill-tools" data-photo-fill-tools hidden><div class="jc-photo-fill-heading"><ActionIcon name="brush" size={30}/><div><strong>Will it fill? Try it here.</strong><span>Check your coloring areas before you print.</span></div></div><div class="jc-photo-fill-controls"><button type="button" data-photo-fill-toggle aria-pressed="false">Try a fill</button><label>Preview color<input type="color" value="#f2aa50" data-photo-fill-color/></label><button type="button" data-photo-fill-undo>Undo fill</button><button type="button" data-photo-fill-clear>Clear colors</button></div><p data-photo-fill-status role="status">Choose Try a fill, then tap a white area. Downloads stay uncolored.</p><small>Keyboard: focus the drawing, use arrow keys to move, and press Enter to fill. Hold Shift for smaller steps.</small></div>
 <details class="jc-photo-retouch" data-photo-retouch hidden><summary>Fine-tune the lines yourself</summary><p>Erase a stray mark, restore a detail, or close a small gap. Your edits carry into downloads and Studio.</p><div class="jc-photo-retouch-tools"><button type="button" data-retouch-tool="erase" aria-pressed="false">Erase stray lines</button><button type="button" data-retouch-tool="restore" aria-pressed="false">Restore details</button><button type="button" data-retouch-tool="ink" aria-pressed="false">Close a gap</button></div><label for="retouch-brush-size">Brush size <output id="retouch-size-label" data-retouch-size-value>12 px</output></label><input type="range" min="1" max="80" value="12" id="retouch-brush-size" data-retouch-size aria-label="Correction brush size"/><div class="jc-photo-retouch-tools"><button type="button" data-retouch-undo disabled>Undo correction</button><button type="button" data-retouch-reset>Restore converted page</button></div></details><div class="jc-photo-fidelity-note"><GlyphIcon name="select" size={22}/><p><strong>Compare before you color.</strong> The model follows the shapes in your photo, but it can simplify or miss details. Use Compare original to check the result. Sharp, well-lit photos work best; blur and hidden detail cannot be recovered.</p></div>
 <section class="jc-photo-export" aria-labelledby="photo-export-title"><div class="jc-photo-export-heading"><div><p>03 · PRINT. SAVE. MAKE IT YOURS.</p><h2 id="photo-export-title">A file for every way you create.</h2></div><PhotoFileIcon format="svg" size={59}/></div><fieldset data-photo-formats disabled><legend class="sr-only">Choose a download format</legend><div class="jc-photo-formats">{PHOTO_FORMATS.map((f,i)=><label><input type="radio" name="photo-format" value={f.id} checked={i===0}/><span><PhotoFileIcon format={f.id} size={48}/><span><strong>{f.label}</strong><small>{f.hint}</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></span></label>)}</div></fieldset><div class="jc-photo-export-actions"><button type="button" class="jc-photo-primary" data-photo-download disabled><PhotoFileIcon format="pdf" size={32}/><span data-photo-download-label>Download PDF</span><ArrowIcon size={20}/></button><button type="button" class="jc-photo-studio" data-photo-studio disabled><ActionIcon name="brush" size={32}/><span>Color in Studio</span><ArrowIcon kind="diagonal" size={18}/></button></div><p class="jc-photo-file-note">PDFs stay under 1 MB. SVG contains vector paths for the drawing’s tones; Word contains the coloring image in a DOCX document. A small JotColoring credit is added below the drawing.</p><p data-photo-export-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
 </section></div>
 <section class="jc-photo-tips"><div><NavPhotoIcon size={48}/><h2>Simple tips.<br/><span>Clearer coloring pages.</span></h2></div><article><span>01</span><h3>Let the light in.</h3><p>Choose a sharp photo with a clear subject. Strong shadows and soft focus can hide the contours you want to keep.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Make the details work for you.</h3><p>Use Clean & simple for textured scenes. Increase Detail to bring out lighter lines, and compare against your original.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Keep a copy you can use.</h3><p>Choose PDF for printing, Image for a smaller file, or PNG for lossless pixels. Use SVG in vector apps and Word in documents.</p></article></section>
</main>
<script>import {mountPhotoConverter} from '../photo/controller';mountPhotoConverter();</script>
